      "customData": {
        "kind": "canvas",
        "title": "Same threshold, different metered response",
        "description": "When the same metered threshold is reached, hard stop on blocks credit-consuming work; hard stop off alerts an owner while charges continue. ULB is always a hard stop in both cases. A forecast, a cap, and purchase authorization are different things; an alert is not approval."
      }
